{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺港傑自辯 前夫鄺港智 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月疑遭殺 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺港傑自辯 前夫鄺港智 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月疑遭殺害及肢解，案件第34日審訊再揭鄺家早於案發前已爆發激烈衝突。前大伯鄺港傑供稱，蔡天鳳曾與前家翁鄺球在加多利山單位互相指罵，兩人更一度企圖衝向對方。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a></p>\n<h2>蔡天鳳知鄺港智有女友反應大向子女哭訴</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑繼續出庭自辯，蔡天鳳母親張燕花於2022年5至6月到廣州探望鄺港智，其間在對方私家車內發現有女性飾物，因而「得悉細佬喺國內有個女朋友」。張燕花把事件告知女兒後，蔡天鳳好大反應，曾在哄孩子入睡時哭訴：「我咁辛苦湊你哋，爸爸就喺嗰邊咁開心有女朋友」，其後更施壓要求鄺港智短期內返港。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<h2>前大伯鄺港傑庭上還原爭吵經過</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑憶述，2022年6月底至7月初，眾人身處加多利山單位，蔡天鳳照顧發燒女兒期間因管教孩子方式與鄺母李瑞香出現分歧，其後高聲責罵對方。鄺球聞聲衝入房間，質問蔡天鳳：「你做乜鬧我老婆！」期間夾雜粗言穢語，身處房間角落的蔡天鳳亦以粗口對罵。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e8%b3%ad%e9%8c%a2-500%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e7%84%a1%e8%a8%bb%e5%86%8a-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2443847/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜丈夫譚方駿與蔡天鳳無註冊原因  譚家被上門收數 譚父曾向鄺球求助</a></p>\n<p>雙方一度欲衝向對方，其餘四人分別上前阻擋，過程爭持約兩至三分鐘。鄺港傑及譚方駿最終將鄺球拉到客廳，並勸服他離開單位，鄺港智則安撫蔡天鳳的情緒。一個多小時後，蔡天鳳與譚方駿離開加多利山豪宅，返回九龍塘住所。</p>\n<p>鄺港傑指「成日鬧我阿媽」，但從未試過如此大聲。他解釋，兩人在管教方法上有些分歧，爺嫲較遷就孫兒，父母則較為嚴格。鄺港傑又指，鄺球也從未試過對蔡天鳳如此惱怒，兩人自此再沒有碰面。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a>\n</p>\n<h2>鄺球被禁足加多利亞山豪宅 到情婦屋企住</h2>\n<p>爭吵結束後，蔡天鳳與譚方駿在個多小時後離開加多利山。鄺港傑表示，蔡天鳳自此禁止鄺球繼續居於該單位，鄺球遂搬往荃灣居屋尚文苑與他同住，但因單位面積較小，只能睡在客廳沙發。鄺球每周約留宿一至兩次，其餘時間則「住情婦屋企」，但不知道情婦的住址。此外，鄺港傑供稱，蔡天鳳與鄺球在那次衝突後再沒有見面。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<p>案件仍在審訊階段，鄺港智、鄺球及鄺港傑均否認謀殺罪，相關證供及指控仍須由法庭依法裁決。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179212714899269_4427372576acc93ffe979a.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179179212714899269_4427372576acc93ffe979a.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e5%90%8d%e4%b8%8b-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-2442309/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜豪宅登記鄺球名下始末 豪宅出資人並非蔡天鳳 蔡母揭女兒收入來源：未婚前已有「億幾兩億」</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%96-%e5%ae%b6%e5%ba%ad%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2440816/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜控方揭蔡天鳳身世學歷背景 買豪宅另有苦衷 母女訊息惹關注 拆解鄺家奪命計劃</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%ad%bb%e5%9b%a0-%e5%a5%b3%e6%b3%95%e9%86%ab%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e7%90%aa-%e9%a0%ad%e9%83%a8-%e5%a4%a7%e5%b0%8f%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e7%a2%8e%e5%b1%8d-%e9%9d%92%e7%b4%85-2452341/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜女法醫親解蔡天鳳真正死因 生前頭部7次重擊 網民痛斥鄺家</a><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e5%a4%b1%e8%b9%a4-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e5%85%ac%e7%9c%be%e5%b8%ad%e7%ac%91-2442712/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n</a></p>\n<br/>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e5%a7%91%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e5%88%a4%e6%b1%ba-%e5%85%92%e5%ad%90%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab-cctv-2451516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜案發後鄺港智與母關鍵對話 李瑞香判決！法官：慈母多敗兒</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">內地女友</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">加多利山</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄺港傑</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2454035\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 10 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.886390+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1652,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:55:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:15.578752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:56.578239+00:00","content_hash":"1540e1d5f79d438fad849d745e96a96c4854215f3aaa5b5e8854e30b7a97f6f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}